# Built probe binaries (Scripts/build-probes.sh) — the repo root ignore's
# Plugins/*/flash-plugin-* pattern is one level deep and misses this tree.
*/flash-plugin-conformance
# The Rust probe is a hermetic crate with a committed lockfile, mirroring
# the root !Plugins/*/Cargo.lock re-include (one level deep, misses us).
!rust/Cargo.lock
